(Note: we have enabled the historical version of the function, the old game unfinished players can now right-click the game -> Properties -> Test -> drop down list -> oldversion, you can continue the old version of the game!

Thought system related:
- the adjustment of the relationship between political philosophy and ideological system;
- Requires the use of specific political philosophy before a particular idea can be adopted;
- Added a new system of beliefs, for the players in the ideological system to provide more choices;

The first major change in the economic system:
- Local initial thought adjustment; (adjusted according to the connection with Central Plains)
- Initial population adjustment of places; (Rising sharply to match historical data)
- local initial property adjustment; (adjusted according to the local topography)
- local building properties adjustment; (now the building properties more reasonable)
- local development and population ceiling adjustment; (development is not enough to accommodate the number of drops)
(Note: the current version of the Central Plains region is very strong)

Army-related changes:
- Sentinel countries are now extremely fast;
- a slight reduction in the maintenance costs of the armies of the Senegalese army;
- The manpower required to build a unit army is now changed to 2000;
- Each country now has an initial, maintenance-free army;
- Son of Heaven national concept there are two additional maintenance-free military;

Difficulties associated with other changes:
- peacetime AI will reduce the tax rate and maintenance costs in order to develop the economy; (good players will not learn to engage in sudden war drops)
- Low difficulty players will have extra money income;
- Now the siege will be reduced by 3.5% of the population growth rate;
-AI is more warlike;
-Small countries are often lit with manpower;
-Small countries are very miserable now
-Small countries are often exterminated;

BUG related changes:
- Fixed a bug about GM directives
- Fixed bugs that army generals could not find from the list of people after disbanded
- Fixed a bug where the local governor showed the capital as a result of illness and not the place of employment
- Fixed a bug when using observer mode for a long time

